    "type": "organization",
    "description": "**We are interested in hearing from people who have used these datasets to improve our products and better understand the impact of this data. [Please consider taking this two-minute survey](https://forms.gle/EQFAbkkPVj5JtkSu7).** AI for Good at Meta's program includes tools built from de-identified data on our platform, as well as tools that we develop using satellite imagery and other publicly available sources. When data is shared responsibly with the communities that need it, it can improve wellbeing and save lives.",
